{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1611","id":4082046663,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87zTxbH","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1611","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1611.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1611.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1611","number":1611,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(storage): add offline OSS inventory and RAM design gate","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- adds a network-incapable, fail-closed offline validator for the canonical Aliyun OSS source-object contract\n- audits competing 9709 QP/MS inventories and records `FULL_UPLOAD_INVENTORY_AUTHORITY=NOT_FROZEN`\n- generates a deterministic four-file candidate manifest (2 QP + 2 MS), with upload authorization explicitly false\n- defines local preflight plus future upload, verification, and failure receipt schemas\n- adds two least-privilege RAM policy designs explicitly marked `NOT_APPLIED`\n\n## Git provenance\n\n- base branch: `main`\n- exact base / origin/main: `ee035f80fc72589fc6732509439ee01ac820f47a`\n- architecture merge ancestry: PASS (the same merge is an ancestor of origin/main)\n- exact head: `1cc9c6749f58bdc258bea269f24d4ddc5c0be056`\n- branch: `task/20260718-aliyun-oss-offline-validator`\n\n## Inventory authority\n\n`FULL_UPLOAD_INVENTORY_AUTHORITY: NOT_FROZEN`\n\nCandidate findings:\n\n- SourceDocumentRegistry: 892 rows = 432 QP + 460 MS; 892 local files; 0 missing; 892 unique stable source IDs; one unresolved same-document-identity/different-hash group represented by two blocked rows\n- deterministic MS inventory: 460 rows; 460 local files; 0 missing; 459 unique MS IDs; the duplicate ID is the unresolved `9709_w21_ms_12` pair\n- physical 9709 MS directory: 470 PDFs = 460 included MS + 10 formally excluded grade-threshold PDFs\n- historical selected-MS extraction pilot: 6 rows; not a full upload inventory\n\nRecommended candidate: the 892-row registry for review/bounded pilot derivation.\nHuman-approved authority: `null`.\n\n## Validator and pilot\n\nThe CLI requires explicit `--offline-only`, inventory, source root, expected count, bucket, region, prefix, and output path. It validates exact count/schema/order, path containment and symlink escape, duplicate/collision states, stable ID/source binding, exact size/hash/PDF magic/MIME, object-key contract, unsupported types/subjects, and governance non-promotion.\n\nStatic guards reject provider/network imports, HTTP clients, fetch, shell network tools, provider credential environment reads, credential-shaped fields, and false remote-success state.\n\nPilot selection is deterministic: for each QP/MS class, exclude blocked, WM-prefixed, and duplicate-suffix sources; choose size-sorted smallest/largest candidates. Result: 4 candidates, all `source_present_unreviewed`, `upload_authorized=false`, `uploaded=false`, and `remote_verified=false`.\n\n## Receipt and RAM design\n\nReceipt schemas:\n\n- local preflight receipt\n- future upload attempt receipt\n- future full-byte verification receipt\n- future failure/partial recovery receipt\n\nRAM profiles:\n\n- local pilot: `oss:PutObject` + `oss:GetObject` on the exact four candidate resources only\n- ECS runtime role: read-only `oss:GetObject` under `sources/caie/*` plus prefix-bounded `oss:ListObjects` constrained by `StringLike oss:Prefix`\n- future ingestion role: `DEFERRED_REQUIRES_SEPARATE_HUMAN_APPROVED_PHASE`\n\nOfficial Alibaba Cloud documentation verified the action names, object/bucket ARN shape, prefix condition, HeadObject-to-GetObject mapping, request-level `x-oss-forbid-overwrite`, ECS instance-role, and STS posture.\n\nCreate-only/no-overwrite verdict: `VERIFICATION_STATUS=OPEN`. RAM policy alone is not proven to test key nonexistence. A future authorized uploader must combine application preflight, same-key hash guard, `x-oss-forbid-overwrite=true`, and Versioning recovery. Versioning is not the no-overwrite guard.\n\nBoth designs are `NOT_APPLIED`; delete, ACL, bucket-admin, lifecycle, encryption, versioning, RAM, and AccessKey-management actions are absent.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run storage:aliyun-oss-offline:test` — PASS\n- `npm run storage:aliyun-oss-offline:write` — PASS; semantic SHA-256 `76963ed88d3173a22b4ebe5cb6e50e402d746f2e67d9577bb1aabdb8dd423f15`\n- `npm run storage:aliyun-oss-offline:check` — PASS at post-commit HEAD\n- standalone 892-row CLI — PASS; 892 valid / 0 invalid\n- repeatability byte comparison — PASS\n- targeted ESLint — PASS\n- JSON parse checks — PASS\n- `npm run quality:report-index` — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n- diff-scoped credential scan — PASS\n- PDF/binary-added guard — PASS\n- `.worktrees` path guard — PASS\n- post-commit `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — clean worktree; only expected pre-push upstream warning\n\n## Zero-network / zero-remote proof\n\n- network calls: 0\n- provider calls: 0\n- OSS API calls: 0\n- uploads: 0\n- remote object reads: 0\n- credentials read or created: 0\n- RAM policies applied: 0\n- Supabase remote mutations: 0\n- database migrations created/applied: 0\n- CDN/lifecycle configuration changes: 0\n\n## Explicit non-authorization\n\nThis Draft PR does not authorize any OSS operation, pilot upload, full upload, credential creation, RAM apply, schema selection, migration, production readiness, launch readiness, extraction readiness, scoring readiness, acceptance, or student visibility. Do not mark Ready or merge without Samsen and independent review.","created_at":"2026-07-18T10:50:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T05:26:46Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T05:26:46Z","merged_at":"2026-07-20T05:26:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"ef0fd6c5cd1fd5357e08158b07921bda8ea41df7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1611/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1611/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1611/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/1cc9c6749f58bdc258bea269f24d4ddc5c0be056","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/20260718-aliyun-oss-offline-validator","ref":"task/20260718-aliyun-oss-offline-validator","sha":"1cc9c6749f58bdc258bea269f24d4ddc5c0be056","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","st